AC15E,"Arcadia is a lovely, versatile, flush mount wall lantern. This design is a perfect companion to our other collections, pairing well with Georgetown, Pebble Hill, Creole and Oakley. The Arcadia is also a good choice in electric as a wall sconce for interior applications such as hallways and corridors.  • Handcrafted from heavy gauge solid copper for long lasting strength and beauty. • Available with electric illumination for convenient energy efficient lighting. • Solid brass hinges and latches provide superior durability and refined detailing. • Mounts and accessories built from marine grade aluminum with a corrosion resistant powder coat finish. • Compatible with standard electric bulbs including LED for customizable lighting output (bulbs not included with fixture). • Designed to withstand harsh climates with copper that naturally develops a rich, timeless patina."
AC18E,"Arcadia is a lovely, versatile, flush mount wall lantern. This design is a perfect companion to our other collections, pairing well with Georgetown, Pebble Hill, Creole and Oakley. The Arcadia is also a good choice in electric as a wall sconce for interior applications such as hallways and corridors.  • Handcrafted from heavy gauge solid copper for long lasting strength and beauty. • Available with electric illumination for convenient energy efficient lighting. • Solid brass hinges and latches provide superior durability and refined detailing. • Mounts and accessories built from marine grade aluminum with a corrosion resistant powder coat finish. • Compatible with standard electric bulbs including LED for customizable lighting output (bulbs not included with fixture). • Designed to withstand harsh climates with copper that naturally develops a rich, timeless patina."
AC18G,"Arcadia is a lovely, versatile flush mount wall lantern crafted for timeless exterior illumination. This design complements many of our signature collections, pairing beautifully with Georgetown, Pebble Hill, Creole, and Oakley. For gas configurations, Arcadia provides the classic ambiance of an open flame and offers a refined lighting solution for exterior walls, entries, and architectural accents.  • Handcrafted from heavy gauge solid copper for long lasting strength and beauty. • Offered with natural gas or propane for a warm authentic flame. • Solid brass hinges and latches provide superior durability and refined detailing. • Mounts and accessories built from marine grade aluminum with a corrosion resistant powder coat finish. • Solid brass gas burner assemblies are CSA certified for safe reliable flame performance. • Designed to withstand harsh climates with copper that naturally develops a rich, timeless patina."
