AP20E,"The CopperSmith has partnered with Biltmore® to create several distinctive new lighting collections that reflect both companies’ shared passion for careful craftsmanship and timeless style. The CopperSmith’s mission to provide the finest selection of the highest quality copper lanterns available ensures that their designs honor Biltmore®’s commitment to authenticity and integrity while also offering a wide range of sophisticated lighting options for today’s homes and businesses.  With his sophisticated design for the Biltmore® Approach Road to Biltmore® House, landscape architect Frederick Law Olmsted created a truly memorable first impression of the estate that inspires our striking Biltmore® Approach Collection.  • Handcrafted from heavy gauge solid copper for long lasting strength and beauty. • Available with electric illumination for convenient energy efficient lighting. • Solid brass hinges and latches provide superior durability and refined detailing. • Mounts and accessories built from marine grade aluminum with a corrosion resistant powder coat finish. • Compatible with standard electric bulbs including LED for customizable lighting output (bulbs not included with fixture). • Designed to withstand harsh climates with copper that naturally develops a rich, timeless patina."
