CS41E,"Conception Street was designed to resemble the copper gas lanterns that adorn Antebellum style townhomes in beautiful downtown Mobile, Alabama. Conception Street borders historic De Tonti Square, named in honor of Italian explorer and entrepreneur Henri De Tonti.  • Handcrafted from heavy gauge solid copper for long lasting strength and beauty. • Available with electric illumination for convenient energy efficient lighting. • Solid brass hinges and latches provide superior durability and refined detailing. • Mounts and accessories built from marine grade aluminum with a corrosion resistant powder coat finish. • Compatible with standard electric bulbs including LED for customizable lighting output (bulbs not included with fixture). • Designed to withstand harsh climates with copper that naturally develops a rich, timeless patina."
