CWS12,"Elevate your home’s ambiance with the sleek and modern Coastal Wall Sconce. Crafted from high-quality solid copper, its minimalist cylindrical design seamlessly integrates into any decor style. This sconce provides soft, diffused lighting, creating a warm and inviting atmosphere. Whether flanking a mirror, illuminating a hallway, or accenting your living space, the Coastal Wall Sconce blends contemporary design with practical elegance.  • Constructed from solid copper that resists corrosion and ages into a warm, natural patina over time. • Dual direction lighting casts both upward and downward beams to accentuate exterior architecture. • Engineered for coastal durability with materials that withstand salt spray, humidity, and year round weather exposure. • Marine grade aluminum mounting components feature a premium powder coat finish for enhanced longevity. • LED compatible for energy efficient lighting output and long term performance. • A modern coastal design perfect for elevating outdoor areas with functional and stylish illumination."
