DN23E,"Just because your style is modern doesn’t mean you have to forgo the warm and welcoming glow of gas lighting. Named after architect Paul Dinardi, our new Dinardi collection perfectly enhances commercial and residential spaces. Go with a black finish for a contemporary look, or choose our solid copper finish for environments where transitional gas lighting is in order.  • Handcrafted from heavy gauge solid copper for long lasting strength and beauty. • Available with electric illumination for convenient energy efficient lighting. • Solid brass hinges and latches provide superior durability and refined detailing. • Mounts and accessories built from marine grade aluminum with a corrosion resistant powder coat finish. • Compatible with standard electric bulbs including LED for customizable lighting output (bulbs not included with fixture). • Designed to withstand harsh climates with copper that naturally develops a rich, timeless patina."
