H6F,"Our Hawthorn copper flush mount ceiling light creates a cozy and comfortable home atmosphere, ideal for any hallway, kitchen, foyer, sunroom, or porch. Certified for both indoor and outdoor use, the Hawthorn coordinates beautifully with our CopperSmith wall light collections.  • Handcrafted from heavy gauge solid copper for long lasting strength and beauty. • Flush mount design provides low profile overhead lighting ideal for porches, covered patios, breezeways, and entryways. • Engineered for both indoor and outdoor use with corrosion resistant materials that withstand humidity and coastal environments. • Precision built marine grade components for durable construction and long term performance. • Compatible with standard electric bulbs including LED for efficient and reliable illumination. • A timeless design that seamlessly pairs with traditional, coastal, and transitional architectural styles."
HL15E,"The Hyland Collection takes its name from the Hyland Estate in Essex, England. The towering corner columns on this estate were the primary inspiration for this design. The Hyland Collection combines contemporary and classic styling to create a timeless design for those looking for a simple, modern style. This lovely design is at home both inside and outside.  • Handcrafted from heavy gauge solid copper for long lasting strength and beauty. • Available with electric illumination for convenient energy efficient lighting. • Solid brass hinges and latches provide superior durability and refined detailing. • Mounts and accessories built from marine grade aluminum with a corrosion resistant powder coat finish. • Compatible with standard electric bulbs including LED for customizable lighting output (bulbs not included with fixture). • Designed to withstand harsh climates with copper that naturally develops a rich, timeless patina."
