KL14-GN14,"The setting for the 1948 classic film noir by John Huston gave the Key Largo Collection its name, inspired by the Benjamin Company’s RLM Dome Reflector lights that had a profound influence on industrial illumination. The Key Largo’s solid copper shade features a stylish dome shape to ensure the light is illuminated downward, and it displays beautifully from a wall mount, pendent, or stem.  • Handcrafted from heavy gauge solid copper for long lasting strength and beauty. • Offered in multiple sizes and shade styles for both residential and commercial applications. • Designed to provide focused, downward illumination ideal for signage, garages, porches, interior and exterior accents. • Built with marine grade aluminum mounts and components for added strength and corrosion resistance. • Compatible with standard electric bulbs including LED for efficient, reliable performance. • Engineered for long term outdoor durability with finishes that resist fading and wear."
