KW14-GN14,"The Key West Collection draws its name and inspiration from the 1948 classic film noir by John Huston, capturing the timeless elegance of the era. Reflecting the iconic design of Benjamin Company’s RLM Dome Reflector lights, which revolutionized industrial lighting, the Key West features a solid copper shade with a sleek fluted shape. Its focused downward illumination makes it perfect for wall mounting, pendant suspension, or stem support.  • Handcrafted from heavy gauge solid copper for long lasting strength and beauty. • Offered in multiple sizes and shade styles for both residential and commercial applications. • Designed to provide focused, downward illumination ideal for signage, garages, porches, interior and exterior accents. • Built with marine grade aluminum mounts and components for added strength and corrosion resistance. • Compatible with standard electric bulbs including LED for efficient, reliable performance. • Engineered for long term outdoor durability with finishes that resist fading and wear."
