OA20E,"Looking for that old French-style lantern found in the great Coastal cities of New Orleans, Charleston, and Mobile? The Oakley will add an elegant accent to your space that cannot be matched. Available in three sizes, the Oakley will work with large homes or commercial buildings and pairs well with the Georgetown Collection. As with all of our lanterns, no quality was compromised in creating these gorgeous Gas and Electric Lanterns.  • Handcrafted from heavy gauge solid copper for long lasting strength and beauty. • Available with electric illumination for convenient energy efficient lighting. • Solid brass hinges and latches provide superior durability and refined detailing. • Mounts and accessories built from marine grade aluminum with a corrosion resistant powder coat finish. • Compatible with standard electric bulbs including LED for customizable lighting output (bulbs not included with fixture). • Designed to withstand harsh climates with copper that naturally develops a rich, timeless patina."
