SO20E,"The Somerset was inspired by the copper gas lighting displayed throughout the picturesque towns and villages of historic Somerset county in England, known as the “Jewel of the Southwest.” These towns and villages are still adorned today with copper gas lighting, and similar designs to the Somerset lantern can be seen all throughout this part of England.  • Handcrafted from heavy gauge solid copper for long lasting strength and beauty. • Available with electric illumination for convenient energy efficient lighting. • Solid brass hinges and latches provide superior durability and refined detailing. • Mounts and accessories built from marine grade aluminum with a corrosion resistant powder coat finish. • Compatible with standard electric bulbs including LED for customizable lighting output (bulbs not included with fixture). • Designed to withstand harsh climates with copper that naturally develops a rich, timeless patina."
