WS23E,"The Water Street Collection is rooted in the vintage aesthetic and charm found in New York City’s lower east side. The Water Street’s traditional design pays homage to lighting of the past and the bustling commercial district found along the river in the “city that never sleeps.” Place this lantern wherever a touch of classicism is needed.  • Handcrafted from heavy gauge solid copper for long lasting strength and beauty. • Available with electric illumination for convenient energy efficient lighting. • Solid brass hinges and latches provide superior durability and refined detailing. • Mounts and accessories built from marine grade aluminum with a corrosion resistant powder coat finish. • Compatible with standard electric bulbs including LED for customizable lighting output (bulbs not included with fixture). • Designed to withstand harsh climates with copper that naturally develops a rich, timeless patina."
