YK16E,"The Yorktown Flush Mount Lantern was inspired by the architecture of Colonial Williamsburg. Its smaller size and low profile make it a good choice for small spaces where you want to make a big impact. The Yorktown collection coordinates beautifully with our CopperSmith Somerset and Market Street English collections.  • Handcrafted from heavy gauge solid copper for long lasting strength and beauty. • Available with electric illumination for convenient energy efficient lighting. • Solid brass hinges and latches provide superior durability and refined detailing. • Mounts and accessories built from marine grade aluminum with a corrosion resistant powder coat finish. • Compatible with standard electric bulbs including LED for customizable lighting output (bulbs not included with fixture). • Designed to withstand harsh climates with copper that naturally develops a rich, timeless patina."
